<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101310"/>
<meta name="description" content="BF GYM Global example fitness plan with a seven-day training schedule, upper and lower body workouts, cardio, recovery and an illustrative meal day."/>
<title>Workout & Nutrition Demo | BF GYM Global</title>
<link rel="icon" href="/bf-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/>
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/app-icon-192.png"/>
</head>
<body>
<div class="site">
<header class="top"><a class="logo" href="/"><span>BF<b>.</b></span> GYM GLOBAL</a><nav aria-label="Demo navigation"><a href="#workouts">WORKOUTS</a><a href="#nutrition">NUTRITION</a><a href="/app/workouts/">VIDEO LIBRARY ↗</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="main-title">
  <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><i></i> BF GYM / TRAINING EDUCATION</p>
  <h1 id="main-title">YOUR PLAN.<br/><em>YOUR PACE.</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-intro">See how a practical training week and balanced eating day could look. Explore strength training, cardio, recovery and sample meals—all in one easy-to-follow demo.</p>
  <div class="hero-links"><a href="#workouts" class="primary">EXPLORE WORKOUT WEEK <span>↘</span></a><a href="#nutrition" class="secondary">VIEW SAMPLE MEALS ↓</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="shape-ring"></span><span class="shape-ring shape2"></span><strong>TRAIN<br/><em>SMART.</em></strong><small>MOVE / FUEL / RECOVER</small></div>
</section>
<div class="demo-banner"><strong>DEMONSTRATION ONLY</strong><span>These are illustrative figures and general fitness ideas—not an individual assessment, diagnosis or prescribed calorie target. No coaching sale or booking is active.</span></div>
<section class="insights" aria-labelledby="insights-title">
  <div class="section-label"><span>01 / EXAMPLE REPORT</span><span>ILLUSTRATIVE VALUES</span></div>
  <h2 id="insights-title">UNDERSTAND THE <em>STARTING POINT.</em></h2>
  <p class="section-intro">The example below uses anonymised fictional values supplied for this demo. Body-composition device readings vary, and personal targets depend on age, height, sex, medical history and other factors.</p>
  <div class="metric-grid">
    <div class="metric"><span>EXAMPLE BODY FAT</span><strong>44.7<small>%</small></strong><p>Context and measurement method matter.</p></div>
    <div class="metric"><span>EXAMPLE MUSCLE MASS</span><strong>36.9<small>kg</small></strong><p>Focus on building and maintaining strength.</p></div>
    <div class="metric"><span>ILLUSTRATIVE GOAL</span><strong>54<small>kg</small></strong><p>Not a recommended target without individual review.</p></div>
    <div class="metric metric-accent"><span>EXAMPLE ENERGY FIGURE</span><strong>1,739<small>kcal</small></strong><p>This is not a universally appropriate intake.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="note">A body-fat percentage target such as 22–28% or a proposed 17 kg reduction should not be treated as a general prescription. Safe and appropriate goals need a qualified assessment. There is no deadline or rapid weight-loss promise in this demo.</p>
</section>
<section id="workouts" class="workouts" aria-labelledby="workout-title">
 <div class="section-label"><span>02 / YOUR DEMO ROUTINE</span><span>7-DAY EXAMPLE</span></div>
 <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="workout-title">A WEEK THAT<br/><em>WORKS FOR YOU.</em></h2></div><p>Three strength sessions, enjoyable cardio and recovery. For the next week, alternate the strength emphasis (B / A / B) to balance the routine over time.</p></div>
 <div class="days" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a day of the workout programme">
  {week.map((w,i)=><button id={'day-tab-'+i} type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="day-panel" aria-selected={i===0?'true':'false'} tabindex={i===0?0:-1} class:list={['day',{active:i===0}]} data-day={i}><span>{w.day.toUpperCase()}</span><strong>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</strong><small>{w.type==='strength'?'LIFT':w.type==='cardio'?'CARDIO':w.type==='hiit'?'MOVE':'REST'}</small></button>)}
 </div>
 <div class="day-panel" id="day-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="day-tab-0">
  <div class="day-panel-top"><div><p class="eyebrow" id="current-tag">{week[0].tag}</p><h3 id="current-name">{week[0].label}</h3><p id="current-focus">{week[0].focus}</p></div><div class="day-duration"><span>EST. TIME</span><strong id="current-minutes">{week[0].minutes}</strong></div></div>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>ACTIVITY</th><th>VOLUME</th><th>COACHING CUE</th><th>DEMO</th></tr></thead><tbody id="exercise-rows">{week[0].items.map(e=><tr><th scope="row">{e[0]}</th><td>{e[1]}</td><td>{e[2]}</td><td><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href={'https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query='+encodeURIComponent(e[0]+' exercise proper form')}>WATCH ↗</a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
 </div>
 <div class="training-notes"><div><strong>WARM UP</strong><p>Aim for approximately 10 minutes of gradual movement before harder exercise.</p></div><div><strong>START LIGHT</strong><p>Choose loads that allow controlled movement. Rest between sets and progress gradually.</p></div><div><strong>RECOVER</strong><p>Build up your training volume at your own pace. Rest or substitute activities when needed.</p></div></div>
 <a class="outline-link" href="/app/workouts/">EXPLORE 64 CURATED DEMOS + 418 EXERCISE SEARCHES <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
<section id="nutrition" class="nutrition" aria-labelledby="nutrition-title">
  <div class="section-label"><span>03 / EXAMPLE NUTRITION</span><span>ONE SAMPLE DAY</span></div>
  <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="nutrition-title">FUEL THE<br/><em>PROGRESS.</em></h2></div><p>A simple example of meals with eggs, yoghurt, chicken, lentils and wholegrains. Quantities and calories are approximate and will vary with products and preparation.</p></div>
  <div class="food-summary"><div><p>ILLUSTRATIVE DAY TOTAL</p><strong>≈ {total.toLocaleString('en-GB')} <small>kcal</small></strong></div><p>Close to the sample report's 1,739 kcal figure, but not an instruction to eat this amount. Energy needs vary widely; some people will require more.</p></div>
  <div class="meal-grid">
    {meals.map(meal=><article class="meal">
      <div class="meal-top"><span>{meal.slot} / {meal.time.toUpperCase()}</span><span>≈ {meal.calories} KCAL</span></div>
      <h3>{meal.name}</h3><ul>{meal.foods.map(food=><li>{food}</li>)}</ul>
      <p>{meal.note}</p>
    </article>)}
  </div>
  <div class="nutrition-bottom"><div><strong>PERSONALISE THE PLATE</strong><p>Adjust portions and foods for your needs, allergies, dietary preferences, budget and culture. Vegetarian swaps can include tofu, beans and lentils; portion size affects total energy and protein.</p></div><div><strong>THE EVERYDAY BASICS</strong><p>Include protein foods, fibre-rich plants and wholegrains; drink regularly (often around 2–2.5 L total fluids daily for adults, depending on needs) and aim for consistent sleep.</p></div></div>
</section>
<section class="final-cta"><p class="eyebrow">LEARN BEFORE YOU TRAIN</p><h2>BUILD CONSISTENCY.<br/><em>KEEP IT SUSTAINABLE.</em></h2><p>Use this plan as a layout example. Anyone beginning exercise with health concerns, injuries, pregnancy or other medical considerations should seek advice from an appropriate clinician or qualified professional before following a demanding routine.</p><div><a class="primary" href="/app/workouts/">EXPLORE FREE EXERCISE VIDEOS <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/" class="secondary">RETURN TO BF GYM GLOBAL</a></div></section>
</main>
<footer class="footer"><a href="/">BF<span>.</span> GYM GLOBAL</a><div><a href="/app/">MOBILE APP</a><a href="/privacy/">PRIVACY</a></div></footer>
</div>
<script define:vars={{ week }}>
 const tabs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-day]'));
 const panel = document.querySelector('#day-panel');
 const tagEl = document.querySelector('#current-tag');
 const dayName = document.querySelector('#current-name');
 const focusEl = document.querySelector('#current-focus');
 const durationEl = document.querySelector('#current-minutes');
 const rows = document.querySelector('#exercise-rows');
 function makeRow(exercise) {
   const row = document.createElement('tr');
   const title = document.createElement('th');
   title.scope = 'row'; title.textContent=exercise[0]; row.append(title);
   const reps = document.createElement('td'); reps.textContent = exercise[1]; row.append(reps);
   const tip = document.createElement('td'); tip.textContent = exercise[2]; row.append(tip);
   const watch = document.createElement('td');
   const a = document.createElement('a');
   a.textContent='WATCH ↗'; a.href='https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query='+encodeURIComponent(exercise[0]+' exercise proper form');
   a.target='_blank'; a.rel='noopener noreferrer'; watch.append(a);row.append(watch);
   return row;
 }
 function chooseDay(index,moveFocus=false) {
   const w=week[index]; if(!w)return;
   tabs.forEach((tab,i)=>{const active=i===index;tab.classList.toggle('active',active);tab.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(active));tab.tabIndex=active?0:-1;});
   if(panel)panel.setAttribute('aria-labelledby','day-tab-'+index);
   if(tagEl)tagEl.textContent=w.tag;
   if(dayName)dayName.textContent=w.label;
   if(focusEl)focusEl.textContent=w.focus;
   if(durationEl)durationEl.textContent=w.minutes;
   if(rows)rows.replaceChildren(...w.items.map(makeRow));
   if(moveFocus)tabs[index].focus();
 }
 tabs.forEach((tab,index)=>{
   tab.addEventListener('click',()=>chooseDay(index));
   tab.addEventListener('keydown',(e)=>{
     let target=index;
     if(e.key==='ArrowRight')target=(index+1)%tabs.length;
     else if(e.key==='ArrowLeft')target=(index+tabs.length-1)%tabs.length;
     else if(e.key==='Home')target=0;
     else if(e.key==='End')target=tabs.length-1;
     else return;
     e.preventDefault();chooseDay(target,true);
   });
 });
</script>
</body>
</html>
